		"The Electric Chainsaw is an axe with abilities that makes mobs drop nitra.",
		"",
		"It must be powered and has abilities: Vein Miner 5, AoE 2, Flat AoE 2, Silk Touch, and Fortune 2.",
		" It also has two Weapon Modifiers, Painsaw and Decapitator.",
		"",
		" Mobs will drop Small Pile of Nitra on death which can be crafted into Nitra or Stimpacks, Nitra can duplicate some types of bullets. ",
		"",
		"The Impact and Spiral Drill work the same as the chainsaw, without the weapon modificators."
